scripts/
========

Helper scripts for the Muesli server. None of these are required at runtime;
they are operator / CI utilities.

Scripts
-------

smoke.sh
End-to-end smoke test for the Muesli API critical path. Registers (or
reuses) a user, logs in, creates a note, obtains a presigned audio upload
URL, uploads a 16-byte fixture, confirms the upload, and polls until the
note reaches status=ready. Configurable via MUESLI_URL, MUESLI_EMAIL, and
MUESLI_PASSWORD environment variables.

diagnose-gpu.sh
Read-only GPU/CUDA diagnostic script. Checks that nvidia-smi is present
and functional, the NVIDIA Container Toolkit (nvidia-ctk) is installed, the
Docker nvidia runtime is configured, NVIDIA kernel modules are loaded,
/dev/nvidia* device nodes exist, and that a GPU is reachable inside a
Docker container (smoke test using nvidia/cuda:12.3.1-base-ubuntu22.04).
Prints [PASS]/[FAIL] with concrete FIX hints and a summary line. Exits 0
always; all output is tee'd to /tmp/muesli-gpu-diag-<timestamp>.log.
